      "tags": [
        "GK",
        "LK"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "math_linalg_c02",
      "front": "Midpoint $M$ of a segment $AB$",
      "back": "$\\vec{m} = \\frac{1}{2} (\\vec{a} + \\vec{b})$",
      "category": "Vectors",
      "tags": [
        "GK",
        "LK"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "math_linalg_c03",
      "front": "Condition for orthogonality\n\n(two vectors are perpendicular)",
      "back": "The dot product is zero.\n\n$\\vec{a} \\cdot \\vec{b} = 0$",
      "category": "Vectors",
      "tags": [
        "GK",
        "LK"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "math_linalg_c04",
      "front": "Formula for the angle $\\alpha$ between two vectors",
      "back": "$\\cos(\\alpha) = \\frac{\\vec{a} \\cdot \\vec{b}}{|\\vec{a}| \\cdot |\\vec{b}|}$",
      "category": "Vectors",
      "tags": [
        "GK",
        "LK"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "math_linalg_c05",
      "front": "Parametric form of a line equation",
      "back": "$\\vec{x} = \\vec{p} + r \\cdot \\vec{u}$\n\nPosition vector + parameter $\\cdot$ direction vector.",
      "category": "Lines & Planes",
      "tags": [
        "GK",
        "LK"
      ]
    },
    {
