      "front": "Read the normal vector from coordinate form\n\n$n_1 x_1 + n_2 x_2 + n_3 x_3 = d$",
      "back": "$\\vec{n} = (n_1, n_2, n_3)^T$",
      "category": "Lines & Planes",
      "tags": [
